{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rise Of Transport</strong> offers an open-world vehicle simulation experience. <br>The game is played from a first-person/third-person perspective of your custom avatar. <br>You can freely ride and dismount your vehicles at will, providing a more immersive vehicle simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy both land and sea vehicles from the early ages of transportation. You can explore the world at your leisure, or engage in commerce by accepting transport jobs. <br>From early horse-drawn carts to massive sail ships, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a realistic yet simplistic approach to vehicle simulation, <strong>Rise Of Transport</strong> offers relaxed gameplay while you enjoy beautiful graphics in a highly optimized environment. <br>Manage your sails and crew, as well as your horses and carts. Play the way you want \u2014 whether you're focusing on exploration, trade, or both. <br>Buy and trade vehicles and properties, expand your fleet, and discover new places. You can also play with friends in cooperative multiplayer mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will include additional downloadable content (DLC) in the future, featuring new eras like the <strong>Industrial Era</strong> and <strong>Modern Era</strong>, with more vehicles and maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note: <strong>This is an Early Access version and not a fully finished game.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602150?t=1743019817","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602150/044eb457b760121a3c8391eb9fdc739aba4dc6b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743019817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602150/4ba6b8eca019506370b894c168a9728459218b51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743019817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s